<title>ISRAEL: U.S. envoy Ross to leave the Middle East.</title>
<headline>U.S. envoy Ross to leave the Middle East.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. envoy Dennis Ross will leave Israel on Wednesday night to brief President Bill Clinton on progress in Israel-PLO peace talks and will return to the region next week, an official involved in the talks said.</p>
<p>Israeli and Palestinian officials have reported progress in talks on Israel's partial withdrawal from Hebron in the West Bank and negotiators are meeting to iron out remaining disputes.</p>
</text>
